<BaseLayout title="About Enfield Zimbabwe" description="Learn about Enfield Zimbabwe’s 85-year history, mission, values and commitment to quality steel and electrical supply."><PageHero eyebrow="About Enfield" title="Decades of supply experience. A practical eye on what comes next." intro="Enfield Zimbabwe is a wholly owned indigenous Zimbabwean company with a history of more than 85 years in cables, electrical equipment and steel." /><section class="section"><div class="container story-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Our story</p><h2>Built around the needs of Zimbabwean industry.</h2></div><div class="prose"><p>Enfield began by supplying domestic and industrial power cables, electrical equipment, structural steel and engineering steel. Its range has since expanded to solar, wire products, automotive supplies and a wider selection of steel.</p><p>That history brings more than product familiarity. It brings an understanding of source markets, specifications, lead times and the coordination required to support customers across the country.</p><blockquote>“To bring the steel and electrical industry a new standard of quality products, professional, technical and innovative service at competitive price, while making customer satisfaction our top priority.”<cite>Enfield mission statement</cite></blockquote></div></div></section><section class="section surface"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">What guides us</p><h2>Principles for responsible, useful business.</h2></div><div class="value-grid"><article><h3>Integrity</h3><p>Fair, honest, transparent and ethical conduct that earns stakeholder trust.</p></article><article><h3>Innovation</h3><p>Using customer insight to approach changing requirements with confidence.</p></article><article><h3>Excellence</h3><p>A clear focus on high standards of quality, service and professional merit.</p></article><article><h3>Teamwork</h3><p>Continuous learning and collaborative relationships built on mutual respect.</p></article><article><h3>Stewardship</h3><p>A safe workplace, care for communities and respect for the environment.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container vision-band"><p class="eyebrow light">Our vision</p><h2>To be Zimbabwe’s benchmark steel and electrical business for value creation, innovation and good corporate governance.</h2></div></section><CTASection /></BaseLayout>
